        "subject": "LU-20692 mdt: add HSM action counters",
        "message": "LU-20692 mdt: add HSM action counters\n\nThe existing HSM request counters describe active requests but do\nnot show how many actions remain queued. Add read-only, per-MDT\nwaiting_count and running_count parameters.\n\nInitialize the counts from the HSM action log during MDT preparation,\nbefore accepting connections. Update atomic counters when non-cancel\nactions enter or leave WAITING and STARTED. Reading either parameter\nthen requires only an atomic read, and pending actions remain counted\nafter an MDT remount or coordinator restart.\n\nTest waiting actions across an MDT remount, then dispatch and\ncompletion of those actions in sanity-hsm test 254c.\n\nSigned-off-by: Praveen Solanki <praveen.solanki@oracle.com>\nAssisted-by: Codex:gpt-6.1-sol\nChange-Id: I72d934e6111c29e9b786c96c1cf1f4f8da535b3a\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
